      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the effort to hold on has become exhausting, and the idea of just letting go is appealing because it promises rest. That feeling of being done with the struggle is a very real and heavy weight to carry. If the fight is too much, maybe the next step isn't to find a new anchor, but to find a way to simply stop exerting that energy. Reaching out to a professional can provide a safe space to explore these feelings without the pressure of having to \"fix\" anything.",
